  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nHCF of 108, 72 and 5a = a\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 108 = 72 × 1 + 36\n\n⇒ 72 = 36 × 2 + 0\n\n⇒ Third number = 5a = 5 × 36 = 180\n\n⇒ Now, we got a = 36\n\n⇒ 108 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 × 3\n\n⇒ 72 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3\n\n⇒ 36 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 3\n\n⇒ LCM of 108, 72 and 36 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 3 × 3 × 2 = 216\n\n**Therefore, the LCM of 108, 72 and a is 216, where a is 36.**",
